---
layout: layouts/base.webc
title: "Posts"
description: "Long-form notes on the projects Ming Liang is building, experiments in progress, and the lessons picked up along the way."
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 motion-rise">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-none">Posts</h1>
    <p class="text-base font-light text-base-content/60 max-w-lg motion-fade motion-delay-1">
      Long-form notes on the projects I am building, experiments I am trying, and
      the lessons picked up along the way.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col motion-rise motion-delay-1">
    <div webc:for="post of collections.posts.toReversed()" class="group border-b border-base-content/8">
      <a
        :href="post.url"
        class="group flex flex-col sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-1 sm:gap-6 py-5 no-underline hover:no-underline"
      >
        <time
          class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/65 shrink-0"
          @text="post.date.toLocaleDateString('en-SG', { day: 'numeric', month: 'short', year: 'numeric' })"
        ></time>
        <h2
          class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content underline decoration-transparent underline-offset-4 group-hover:decoration-current transition-[text-decoration-color] duration-200"
          @text="post.data.title"
        ></h2>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
